{"type":"text","timestamp":1778895602255,"sessionID":"ses_1d1908a70ffe1xtV1mZfO4OTVc","part":{"id":"prt_e2e70c231001KJZ6IkFG2RWEBU","messageID":"msg_e2e6fb71500122Mi3MyVIeXP48","sessionID":"ses_1d1908a70ffe1xtV1mZfO4OTVc","type":"text","text":"I’ve got the hypothesis: eliminate false load-use bubbles by making dependency detection source-aware instead of treating every `instr[24:20]` as a live `rs2`. I’m writing that as the requested YAML now.","time":{"start":1778895602225,"end":1778895602249},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_00a71c43a917fc83016a07caf1efc08199991414248d6b94cb","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778895603435,"sessionID":"ses_1d1908a70ffe1xtV1mZfO4OTVc","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_yVcYSAiYb2noHtKePNsUpeZg","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep3/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-001-r1s0.yaml\n+id: hyp-20260515-001-r1s0\n+title: \"Gate false load-use stalls\"\n+category: micro_opt\n+motivation: |\n+  The current hazard check treats both raw IF/ID register fields as live sources,\n+  even when the decoded instruction does not actually read rs2. That can inject\n+  avoidable one-cycle bubbles on immediate, jump, fence, and system instructions.\n+  Removing those false stalls should raise CoreMark IPC without changing ISA behavior.\n+hypothesis: |\n+  Add source-usage awareness to load-use detection so only instructions that\n+  truly consume rs1/rs2 participate in the dependency compare. Keep the existing\n+  stall/flush rules, but stop stalling on encodings whose rs2 bits are just\n+  immediate payload. This should recover wasted cycles in branch- and immediate-\n+  heavy CoreMark code with minimal RTL risk.\n+expected_impact:\n+  fitness_delta_pct: 6\n+  confidence: medium\n+changes:\n+  - file: rtl/core.sv\n+    description: \"Pass decoded instruction context into the hazard path so dependency checks can distinguish real operands from immediate fields.\"\n+  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n+    description: \"Gate load-use compares with source-usage information and remove false bubbles for instructions that do not actually read rs2.\"\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-001-r1s0.yaml","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep3/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-001-r1s0.yaml\n==================================