 \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a tiny return-address stack, push return PCs on JAL, and speculatively steer JALR-return fetches from the stack instead of waiting for EX.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a tiny return-address stack, push return PCs on JAL, and speculatively steer JALR-return fetches from the stack instead of waiting for EX.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 283.5, \"delta_pct\": -8.82, \"vs_baseline\": 0.24, \"fmax_mhz\": 140.02, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4938989, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 10613, \"ff\": 2124, \"seeds\": [140.02, 139.57, 151.91], \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-16T03:47:21.033640Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 2, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-05-15 hyp-20260515-003-r2s2 (regression, -8.82%): A tiny fetch-side return stack only pays off if return prediction stays ...","metadata":{"matches":4,"truncated":false},"title":"structural|Registered Fetch/Decode Cutpoint|return stack|backward branch|precompute PC-relative targets","time":{"start":1778903314177,"end":1778903314207}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0189916488f2ce1f016a07e911e6bc819a8ca59d4dbb8b732b"}},"id":"prt_e2ee66ea1001TV2t48FA9YRzTm","sessionID":"ses_1d119b880ffeA5NVwid0iCtCqJ","messageID":"msg_e2ee65d56001o65AbHLnHvyHN7"}}
