istered PC-relative target field to the ID/EX bundle so the earlier stage can carry branch/JAL destinations forward.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compute the PC-relative target alongside decode and latch it with the rest of the ID/EX payload.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Use the precomputed PC-relative target for branches and JAL, leaving only JALR target formation in EX.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a registered PC-relative target field to the ID/EX bundle so the earlier stage can carry branch/JAL destinations forward.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compute the PC-relative target alongside decod...\n  Line 7: {\"id\": \"hyp-20260515-003-r2s2\", \"title\": \"Tiny return stack\", \"category\": \"predictor\", \"motivation\": \"CoreMark mixes tight loops with frequent call/return traffic. The prior\\nbackward-branch predictor did not recover enough because it ignored the\\nexpensive JALR returns that dominate many short subroutine paths.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"CoreMark mixes tight loops with frequent call/return traffic. The prior\\nbackward-branch predictor did not recover enough because it ignored the\\nexpensive JALR returns that dominate many short subroutine paths.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Add a very small fetch-stage return-address stack in `if_stage.sv` and use\\nit to predict JALR returns (JALR x0, x1/x5, 0) directly in fetch. Keep\\nEX-stage redirects as the recovery path for non-return JALR and any\\nmispredicts. This should remove a high-value class of control-flow bubbles\\nwith less timing risk than a broader branch predictor.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a tiny return-address stack, push return PCs on JAL, and speculativel