5056}},\"cost\":0}}\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1778914309206,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d07251f5ffeB85JRWRTYUU5tY\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2f8e3437001VJrY86nyx2sZbm\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2f8e2aac001xT02xg3EgxKuuU\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d07251f5ffeB85JRWRTYUU5tY\",\"snapshot\":\"3c8a7a8020e9dca93a57142c8f413102e396db8c\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n{\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1778914356780,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d07251f5ffeB85JRWRTYUU5tY\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2f8eed67001x7TqS4AkwHP9PS\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2f8e2aac001xT02xg3EgxKuuU\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d07251f5ffeB85JRWRTYUU5tY\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Writing the hypothesis now: a tiny 2-way tagged BTB/BHT in fetch, aimed at reducing aliasing rather than adding more speculative machinery.\",\"time\":{\"start\":1778914356583,\"end\":1778914356736},\"metadata\":{\"openai\":{\"itemId\":\"msg_0d761fa1f40705e9016a0814344d84819a881dabebeede8a70\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}}}}\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1778914357696,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d07251f5ffeB85JRWRTYUU5tY\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"apply_patch\",\"callID\":\"call_DiEIot8xuIZxCgwA9CFsVKGO\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"patchText\":\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Add File: cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260516-003-r6s2.yaml\\n+id: hyp-20260516-003-r6s2\\n+title: \\\"Tagged 2-way branch predictor\\\"\\n+category: predictor\\n+motivation: |\\n+  The prior predictor attempts lost ground mostly to aliasing and fetch-side\\n+  bookkeeping, not because CoreMark lacks repeated control flow. A smaller but\\n+  better-indexed predictor should recover hot loop and call targets without the\\n+  wrong-target churn that hurt the direct-mapped BTB/BHT.\\n+hypothesis: |\\n+  Replace the direct-mapped fetch predictor with a tiny 2-way tagged BTB/BHT in\\n+  `if_stage.sv`, using 2-bit counters and stored targets for taken conditional\\n+  branches and JAL while leaving JALR fully reactive in EX. The extra way and\\n+  tags should cut aliasing on CoreMark's small hot branch set, so the predictor\\n+  keeps its best entries alive without adding the deeper bookkeeping that hurt\\n+  the return-stack and loop-only variants.\\n+expected_impact:\\n+  fitness_delta_pct: 4\\n+  confidence: medium\\n+changes:\\n+  - file: rtl/if_stage.sv\\n+    description: \\\"Add a tiny 2-way tagged BTB/BHT, use it to steer fetch on hot taken branches/JAL, and keep EX redirects as recovery for JALR and mispredicts.\\\"\\n*** End Patch\"},\"output\":\"Success. Updated the following files:\\nA cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260516-003-r6s2.yaml\",\"metadata\":{\"diff\":\"Index: /Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep3/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260516-003-r6s2.yaml\\n===================================================================\\n--- /Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep3/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260516-003-r6s2.yaml\\n+++ /Users/bo... (line truncated to 2000 chars)","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260516-003-r6s2.log","time":{"start":1778922979690,"end":1778922980054}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0aa39ed9c1054697016a0835e37de4819bb2c8d4927604d31d"}},"id":"prt_e30128157001SvnIi7DygaalFd","sessionID":"ses_1cfeed19fffe9P8gu0tomAH3fh","messageID":"msg_e30125cba001NursdB1m2wkYqP"}}
