 a registered PC-relative target field to the ID/EX bundle so the earlier stage can carry branch/JAL destinations forward.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compute the PC-relative target alongside decode and latch it with the rest of the ID/EX payload.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Use the precomputed PC-relative target for branches and JAL, leaving only JALR target formation in EX.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a registered PC-relative target field to the ID/EX bundle so the earlier stage can carry branch/JAL destinations forward.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compute the PC-relative target alongside decod...","metadata":{"matches":2,"truncated":false},"title":"call-target|direct call|JAL target|call site|call predictor|JAL only","time":{"start":1778934536010,"end":1778934536323}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0fbb72654bb10e87016a086307c3748198b1fe8d24542364ef"}},"id":"prt_e30c2d72c001iGvIrj6v3tLtt6","sessionID":"ses_1cf3dfab1ffebLwYgexkhWsZ55","messageID":"msg_e30c22560001xhKtKfI1pROttq"}}
