ants.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"CoreMark still spends a lot of time in tight loop backedges, but the\\nbroader predictor attempts lost ground to fetch-side bookkeeping, aliasing,\\nand Fmax pressure. A much narrower predictor that only helps the hot\\nbackward conditional-branch case should recover useful bubbles without\\ncarrying the extra state that hurt the earlier BTB, RAS, and loop variants.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Add a branch-only fetch predictor in `rtl/if_stage.sv` that predicts\\nbackward conditional branches as taken and steers fetch directly to the\\ncomputed branch target. Do not speculate JAL/JALR, do not add a BTB/BHT or\\nreturn stack, and keep EX-stage redirect as the recovery path for all\\nmisses. This keeps the predictor logic small while targeting the loop\\nbackedges CoreMark repeats most often.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a minimal backward-conditional-branch predictor that computes the B-type target in fetch and redirects only for predicted-taken loop backedges.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a minimal backward-conditional-branch predictor that computes the B-type target in fetch and redirects only for predicted-taken loop backedges.\"}], \"outcome\": \"improvement\", \"fitness\": 394.64, \"delta_pct\": 10.5, \"vs_baseline\": 39.54, \"fmax_mhz\": 186.22, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 471...","metadata":{"matches":34,"truncated":false},"title":"micro_opt|forward|decode|hazard|rvfi|pipeline|stall|branch|predict","time":{"start":1778996199970,"end":1778996200005}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_066069e927f32464016a0953e7ced481908965c8e14b206021"}},"id":"prt_e346fc20b001VkrAfSHxGmjqWr","sessionID":"ses_1cb905347ffeY45FPdLrmabthk","messageID":"msg_e346fad72001hDm4WVgDRSBYRP"}}
