t changing the pipeline contract.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"ID still rebuilds immediates on every instruction even though the value is\\nonly a function of the fetched word. Moving that bit-slice out of the decode\\ncone should shorten the common ID path without changing the pipeline contract.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Add a precomputed immediate field to the IF/ID bundle, generate it from the\\nregistered instruction in fetch, and have ID consume that latched value\\ninstead of instantiating `imm_gen` locally. Keep stall, flush, redirect, and\\nRVFI behavior unchanged; this is only a structural split of the immediate\\nconstruction logic so decode can spend less time on the critical path.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add an immediate field to the IF/ID bundle so fetch can carry the precomputed value forward.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compute the instruction immediate after the fetch register and latch it with the IF/ID payload.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Consume the precomputed immediate from the bundle and drop the local `imm_gen` instance.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add an immediate field to the IF/ID bundle so fetch can carry the precomputed value forward.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compute the instruction immediate after the fetch register and latch it with the IF/ID payload.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Consume the precomputed immediate from the bundle and drop the local `imm_gen` i...","metadata":{"matches":28,"truncated":false},"title":"regfile|forward|bypass|x0|hazard","time":{"start":1779000053036,"end":1779000053069}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_001694099832e069016a0962f4e7e08190985085331326