{"type":"text","timestamp":1778990335850,"sessionID":"ses_1cbeac72cffe9EOZuzQbdpw7Cq","part":{"id":"prt_e3416470c001NCNU0HVbqpjpDr","messageID":"msg_e3415d297001RXYk8aYzJVQBwl","sessionID":"ses_1cbeac72cffe9EOZuzQbdpw7Cq","type":"text","text":"The safest structural bet is a narrower stage split: move only immediate generation out of ID, not full predecode or branch logic. I’m writing that as the hypothesis now.","time":{"start":1778990335756,"end":1778990335849},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0e750b44c9d2210e016a093cffa45c81939307d71290910f3b","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778990337978,"sessionID":"ses_1cbeac72cffe9EOZuzQbdpw7Cq","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_ATEjyXsw9Zhh78Y9n5inSLkg","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260517-002-r10s1.yaml\n+id: hyp-20260517-002-r10s1\n+title: \"Hoist immediates out of ID\"\n+category: structural\n+motivation: |\n+  ID still spends combinational time rebuilding immediates on every instruction,\n+  even after fetch was turned into a registered cutpoint. That logic is\n+  independent of regfile reads and most control decisions, so moving it earlier\n+  should trim the ID-stage cone without changing the architectural contract.\n+hypothesis: |\n+  Add a precomputed immediate field to the IF/ID bundle, generate it in\n+  `if_stage.sv` from the registered instruction, and have `id_stage.sv`\n+  consume that latched value instead of instantiating `imm_gen` locally. Keep\n+  stall, flush, redirect, and RVFI behavior unchanged; this is only a pipeline\n+  split of the immediate-construction logic.\n+expected_impact:\n+  fitness_delta_pct: 4\n+  confidence: medium\n+changes:\n+  - file: rtl/core_pkg.sv\n+    description: \"Add an immediate field to the IF/ID bundle so fetch can carry the precomputed value forward.\"\n+  - file: rtl/if_stage.sv\n+    description: \"Compute the decoded immediate after the fetch register and latch it with the IF/ID payload.\"\n+  - file: rtl/id_stage.sv\n+    description: \"Consume the precomputed immediate from the bundle and drop the local imm_gen instance.\"\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260517-002-r10s1.yaml","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep3/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260517-002-r10s1.yaml\n===================================================================\n--- /U