ish real operands from immediate fields.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Gate load-use compares with source-usage information and remove false bubbles for instructions that do not actually read rs2.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 6, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Pass decoded instruction context into the hazard path so dependency checks can distinguish real operands from immediate fields.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Gate load-use compares with source-usage information and remove false bubbles for instructions th...\n  Line 4: {\"id\": \"hyp-20260515-003-r1s2\", \"title\": \"Static backward branch prediction\", \"category\": \"predictor\", \"motivation\": \"CoreMark spends a lot of time in tight loops and call-heavy control flow.\\nThe current core always waits for EX to resolve taken branches, so every\\ncorrectly taken loop branch pays the full redirect bubble.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"CoreMark spends a lot of time in tight loops and call-heavy control flow.\\nThe current core always waits for EX to resolve taken branches, so every\\ncorrectly taken loop branch pays the full redirect bubble.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Add a tiny fetch-stage predictor in `if_stage.sv` that predecodes the\\ncurrent instruction, predicts backward conditional branches and JAL as\\ntaken, and feeds the predicted target into the PC register immediately.\\nKeep EX-stage redirects as the recovery path for JALR and any mispredicts.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 8, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a low-cost static predictor that computes branch/JAL targets in fetch and steers the PC before EX resolves the control flow.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 8, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\"